# Cubeless RX global brightness — 2026-09-15

The owned BP now exposes `GlobalSkyCloudIntensity` as **기본 설정 → 스카이돔 글로벌 밝기**.
Default 1, minimum 0, slider maximum 4; instance editable and exposed to cinematics.
The existing UpdateSky scalar setter now reads this variable and the existing
sky-to-cloud MID copy propagates it. No new runtime class or MCP reference is used.

The owned cloud material composes at unit global intensity and scales final RGB
once. Alpha, solar occlusion, night transition and fog flags are unchanged.
Sky and celestial rendering use their existing global intensity parameter.
Scene lights and fog retain separate controls. The current actor was restored
to brightness 1 after verification; the user's dirty preview map was not saved.

